			"notes": "# Bond of the Beast 2.0.0\n\nMinecraft 1.20.1 / Fabric\n\n- Reworked voluntary contracts and forced taming, with stage-based commands, resistance and permanent bonds.\n- Removed bond leveling and legacy combat buffs; expanded restrictions, armor management and item forwarding.\n- Redesigned the Grimoire and Pet Diary, with 3D portraits, clearer controls and live pet status.\n- Improved collars, rendered leashes, pet beds, respawn rules and the sit command.\n- Added familiar fox integration, protective accessories, an energy source ring and catalyst cookies.\n- Updated item textures and added visible eating effects and sounds when feeding pets."
		},
